' Independently authored Kobrixa example
' Call a Function with typed input parameters to draw text.
Folder "prjs" "Kobrixa"

ShowLine(8, 16, "Typed inputs")
Program.Delay(1000)
Function ShowLine(in number x, in number y, in string message)
  LCD.Clear()
  LCD.Text(1, x, y, 1, message)
  LCD.Update()
EndFunction
